## Component Installation
- Install Shadcn UI components using CLI
- Use `pnpm dlx shadcn-ui@latest add [component]`
- Never copy/paste Shadcn component code
- Keep Shadcn components in `components/ui`
- Update themes through `components/ui/themes.ts`
- Maintain registry.json for installed components
- Use proper component initialization

## Component Structure
- Use installed Shadcn UI components as base
